{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.getOne\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">getOne</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.RingM\">RingM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The numeral `1` of the current ring, internalized as a ring term of the current goal.\nThe term is cached in the `Sym.Arith` record and thus shared by all goals, but internalization\nis per goal. The term may already be known to the core (e.g., as a subterm of a product) without\nhaving been registered by the ring solver, so the check is against the ring's own `denote` map.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.getOne","kind":"def","line":199,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.getOne","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.lean#L199-L215"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/RingM.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.instMonadMkVarRingM\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">instMonadMkVarRingM</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a hr